flowchart LR
  W["Working copy<br/>edit files"] -->|git add · git commit| B["Branch<br/>feature/…"]
  B -->|git push| R["GitHub<br/>the shared copy"]
  R --> PR["Pull request<br/>diff · review · checks"]
  PR -->|merge| M["main"]
  M -->|Harness deploys| P["Astro · Databricks"]
  M -.->|git pull| W
  class W yellow
  class B blue
  class R,PR focus
  class M green
  class P grey
